# Regression test for a stack overflow in HIR-to-MIR lowering (SQL-509): a
# CASE with many WHEN arms plans to a deeply right-nested chain of
# HirScalarExpr::If nodes, and lowering used to clone the whole remaining
# chain at every level, overflowing the stack in the derived Clone impl.

